      "text": "- perform binary search for the square root\n- use 3 pointers (l, m, r)\n- run while l < r\n- start looking for a value which is half of input\n- if multiplication is equal to \"x\", return\n- if greater -> rebind r pointer\n- if smaller -> rebind l pointer, save possible result",
